{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSPredicate","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSPredicate"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"predicate"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the style layer’s predicate to include only the features in the source","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"layer that satisfy a condition that you define. If the style layer initially","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"comes from the style, its predicate corresponds to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"filter"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property in the style JSON.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"See the “","type":"text"},{"text":"Predicates and Expressions","type":"text"},{"text":"”","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"guide for details about the predicate syntax supported by this class.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Example","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To filter the layer to include only the features whose ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"index"},{"text":" attribute is 5","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or 10 and whose ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ele"},{"text":" attribute is at least 1,500, you could create an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSCompoundPredicate"},{"text":" along these lines:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["let layer = MLNLineStyleLayer(identifier: \"contour\", source: terrain)","layer.sourceLayerIdentifier = \"contours\"","layer.predicate = NSPredicate(format: \"(index == 5 || index == 10) && CAST(ele, 'NSNumber') >=","1500.0\") mapView.style?.addLayer(layer)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer\/predicate","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnvectorstylelayer\/predicate"]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"title":"predicate","symbolKind":"property","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNVectorStyleLayer(py)predicate","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"predicate"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"predicate","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"abstract":[{"text":"The style layer’s predicate.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"MapLibre","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource","type":"topic","abstract":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies vector shapes to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shown on the map. The shapes may be instances of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or they may be defined by local or external"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GeoJSON"},{"type":"text","text":" code. A shape source is added to an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle"},{"type":"text","text":" object along with an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle"},{"type":"text","text":" object. The vector style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layer defines the appearance of any content supplied by the shape source. You"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can update a shape source by setting its "},{"code":"shape","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"URL","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSource","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MLNShapeSource","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNVectorStyleLayer/predicate":{"fragments":[{"text":"predicate","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnvectorstylelayer\/predicate","kind":"symbol","title":"predicate","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The style layer’s predicate."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer\/predicate","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNVectorStyleLayer":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","